//! The normalizers and stemmers of the Hindi and Bengali analyzers. Generated by the lane's
//! `gen_indic.py` from what the reference search server 1.70.6 gives: the composition pairs were found by asking it
//! for every independent vowel, vowel sign and consonant of the nine Indic scripts followed by
//! every letter of its script, and the Bengali endings from the vocabulary of the language and
//! 26 793 words made of a stem and one of its endings. Both analyzers are equal to the reference search server on
//! their vocabularies (recorded data, `analyzers/vocab/`).

use super::light::ends;

